-- One-time seed: merges the old hardcoded Vocabulary + Spelling banks (English
-- track, Year 4/5/6) into the managed shared_words pool as admin-owned rows, so
-- both Quiz's Vocabulary category and Spelling practice draw from one pool per
-- level, every word carries both an English and a Korean definition, and the
-- whole set becomes editable from the admin's My Added Words section.
--
-- Run once against production:
--   npx wrangler d1 execute englishwordspractice --remote --file=./migrations/0002_merge_vocab_spelling_pool.sql
--
-- Safe to re-run: each row upserts by a stable id (ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE), so running
-- this twice just refreshes the same 217 rows instead of duplicating them.

